# Credentials -- never commit. Recreate locally from your own OBS
# WebSocket settings (Tools > WebSocket Server Settings).
scripts/obs_config.txt

# Runtime state files written fresh by every run -- not meaningful to
# track, just scratch output. Broadened 2026-08-22 from individually
# named files to the whole underscore-prefixed pattern this project uses
# for anything written by a live run (recording-monitor selection, cache
# progress, and every ad-hoc diagnostic dump), since new ones keep
# getting added and each was getting missed here one at a time.
scripts/_*.txt
d4_anim_sample/_*.txt
d4_anim_sample/_*.png

# Sampled ROM caches -- generated data keyed by animation-reference path
# on this machine, not source. Rebuildable via the Cache button.
d4_anim_sample/*.json
